# Inkling full-cudagraph form: the model defaults to breakable/piecewise capture
# (upstream DEFAULT_BREAKABLE_CUDAGRAPH_ARCHITECTURES) but the image's global
# VLLM_USE_BREAKABLE_CUDAGRAPH=0 forces FULL_DECODE_ONLY. Measured 128K decode:
# 21.77 -> 20.00 ms/token (-8.1%) with piecewise on (task/thor/inkling2-phase2/).
VLLM_USE_BREAKABLE_CUDAGRAPH=1
